            2890     2               !*  6 * PIACR : ACCRETION OF QR OR QG BY QI                       ***6**
            2891     2               !* 34 * pwacs : collection of qs by qc                            **34**
            2892     2               
            2893     2   p    v                pihms(i)=0.0
            2894     2   s    s                pihmg(i)=0.0
