            3184     2   p    v              esi(i)=1.0 !egc constant in consatrh via r14f/rn14; use esi( ) to make f(T)/f(q)
            3185     2   p    v              dmicrong=(r00(i)*qg(i)/roqg/cpi/(tng*ftng(i)))**.25*1.e4
