            3613     2               !* 11 * PSMLT : MELTING OF QS                                     **11**
            3614     2               !* 19 * PGMLT : MELTING OF QG TO QR                               **19**
            3615     2               
            3616     2   s    s                psmlt(i)=0.0
            3617     2   s    s                pgmlt(i)=0.0
            3618     2   s    s                phmlt(i)=0.0
            3619     2               
